Add missing <stdio.h> include for fputs/stderr in w_dir.c.

Upstream xfig 3.2.9a relies on transitive includes that the host clang
toolchain on macOS does not provide; on Linux they leak in via X11
headers.  Explicitly include stdio.h so the build is portable.

--- a/src/w_dir.c
+++ b/src/w_dir.c
@@ -65,6 +65,7 @@

 #include <errno.h>
 #include <pwd.h>
+#include <stdio.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <string.h>
 #include <sys/stat.h>
